# HR Dashboard

## Overview

This Power BI HR Dashboard was created to analyze workforce data and provide insights into employee demographics, performance, and organizational trends.

The dashboard combines data modeling, DAX calculations, and interactive visualizations to help monitor key HR metrics and support data-driven decision making.

## Features

* Employee Overview
* Department-wise Analysis
* Workforce Distribution
* KPI Cards and Summary Metrics
* Interactive Filters and Slicers
* Trend Analysis and Visual Reporting

## Skills Demonstrated

* Power Query Transformations
* Data Modeling
* DAX Measures
* KPI Development
* Dashboard Design
* Interactive Reporting
* Data Visualization

## Learning Outcome

This project helped strengthen my skills in end-to-end Power BI development, from data preparation and modeling to creating professional and interactive business dashboards.
